    <h2>14-Day Refund Policy</h2>
    <p>We want you to be satisfied with your purchase. If the Better Credit Guide does not meet your expectations, you may request a refund within 14 days of your purchase date.</p>

    <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
    <p>To request a refund, please contact us through our <a href="/support">Support page</a> with your order reference number and reason for the refund request.</p>

    <h2>Refund Processing</h2>
    <p>Approved refunds will be processed within 5-10 business days and will be returned to your original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email once the refund has been processed.</p>

    <h2>Download Limitation</h2>
    <p>If a refund is requested, your download link will be revoked, and you will no longer have access to the guide.</p>

    <h2>Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to deny refund requests that appear fraudulent or abusive, including repeated purchases followed by refund requests.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this policy, please <a href="/support">contact us</a>.</p>
